From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:09:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/17] tu/autotune: Estimate GMEM and sysmem time from per-GPU
 costs

Instead of comparing byte counts with fixed weights, estimate how long each mode takes using costs measured on
real devices. GPUs without their own entry use the closest one from the same generation, and
TU_AUTOTUNE_CALIB=off keeps the old heuristic.
